{"id":"word:hebrew:H5771","type":"word","title":"עָוֺן","subtitle":"H5771 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"perversity , i.e. (moral) evil","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to עָוֺן (H5771) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 232 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"עָוֺן (ʻâvôn) means perversity , i.e. (moral) evil First listed occurrence: 1Chr 21 8."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"עָוֺן","transliteration":"ʻâvôn","pronunciation":"aw-vone'","strong":"H5771","lemmaId":"hebrew:H5771","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["עֲוֺ֣ן","עֲוֺ֥ן","עֲוֺנָ֔/ם","עֲוֺנָ֑/ם","בַּ/עֲוֺ֣ן"],"morphs":[["HNcbsc",39],["HNcbsa",31],["HNcbsc/Sp3mp",26],["HR/Ncbsc",11],["HR/Ncbsc/Sp3ms",10],["HNcbsc/Sp3ms",9],["HNcbsc/Sp2fs",9],["HNcbsc/Sp1cs",7],["HR/Ncbsc/Sp1cs",7],["HNcbpc/Sp2mp",7]]},"definitions":{"short":"perversity , i.e. (moral) evil","usage":"fault, iniquity, mischeif, punishment (of iniquity), sin.","full":"H5771. avon עָוֺן noun masculine Isa 22:14 iniquity, guilt, or punishment of iniquity ; — ׳ע absolute Exodus 21:43 +; עָווֺן 2Kin 7:9 ; Psa 51:7 ; construct עֲוֺן Gen 15:16 +; עֲווֺן 1Chr 21:8 ; suffix עֲוֺנִי Gen 4:13 + ( 2Sam 16:12 read בְּעָנְיִי ), עֲוֺנְךָ Hosea 9:7 +; עֲוֺנֵ֑כִי Psa 103:3 ; עֲוֺ֔נָהֿ Num 15:31 (Ges § 91e ), etc.; plural עֲוֺנוֺת absolute Psa 130:3 +, construct Job 13:26 +; עַוֺנֹת absolute Psa 65:4 , construct Lev 16:21 +; suffix עֲוֺנֹתֶיךָ Isa 43:24 , עֲוֺנֹתֵיכֶם Num 14:34 +, etc.; also עֲוֺנֶיךָ Ezek 28:18 ; עֲוֺנֵינוּ Isa 64:6 +, etc. (SS doubt all these); — 1 iniquity , Job 15:5 ; 20:27 ; Jer 11:10 ; 14:7 ; 16:17 ; Lam 2:14 ; Ezek 7:13 ; || חטאת 1Sam 20:1 ; Job 13:23 ; Isa 5:18 ; 43:24 ; 59:2 ; Jer 5:25 ; 16:10 ; Lam 4:6 , 13 ; Dan 9:16 ; Hosea 4:8 ; 13:12 ; || פשׁע Job 14:17 ; 31:33 ; Psa 107:17 ; Isa 50:1 ; 53:5 ; || אשׁמה Ezra 9:6-7 , 13 ; רעה Job 22:5 ; Hosea 7:1 a. ׳ע נְעוּרַי Job 13:26 iniquities of my youth ; ׳ע חֶרֶב 19:29 iniquities calling for the sword ; ׳ע מְּלִילִי(םׅ 31:11 , 28 iniquity for (to be punished by) judges ; עֲוֺנֹתָם שְׁתֵּי Hosea 10:10 (so read Vrss Hi and others); בע ׳כשׁל stumble by iniquity 5:5 ; 14:2 ; compare ע ׳מִכְשׁוֺל Ezek 7:19 ; 14:3-4 , 7 ; 18:30 ; 44:12 ; לכלעֿון Deut 19:15 ; מע ׳אשׁתמרה 2Sam 22:24 = Psa 18:24 . אֲשֶׁרחֵֿטְא עָוֺן Hosea 12:9 . b. iniquity as recognized, ע ׳ידע 1Sam 3:13 ; Isa 59:12 ; Jer 3:13 ; 14:20 ; confessed, ע ׳התודה Lev 16:21 ; 26:40 (twice in verse) (P), Neh 9:2 ; ע ׳הגיד Psa 38:19 ; ע כסה ׳לא 32:5 ; brought to remembrance, ע ׳הזכיר Num 5:15 (P) 1Kin 17:18 ; Ezek 21:28 ; 21:29 ; 29:16 ; causing shame, מע ׳יִכָּֽלְמוּ 43:10 ; turned from, מע ׳שׁוּב Dan 9:13 , compare מע ׳השׁיב Mal 2:6 . c. (1) phrases of punishment: ע ׳פקד על Exod 20:5 = Deut 5:9 ; Exod 34:7 ; Num 14:18 (J), Lev 18:25 (H) 2Sam 3:8 ; Isa 13:11 ; 26:21 ; Jer 25:12 ; 36:31 ; Amos 3:2 ; without על , Lam 4:22 , ע ׳פקד ב Psa 89:33 ; Job 11:6 see [II. נשׁא ]; ע על ׳יסּר Psa 39:12 chastise for iniquity ; ע לנגדךָ׳שַׁתָּ֯ 90:8 set our iniquities before thee ; כע ׳גמל 103:10 ; ע ׳שׁמר 130:3 ; ע ׳שׁלּם Isa 65:7 (twice in verse); Jer 16:18 ; 32:18 ; בע ׳מַטְבֵּחַ Isa 14:21 ; (2) of forgiveness or removal: ע העביר 2Sam 24:10 = 1Chr 21:8 ; Job 7:21 ; Zech 3:4 ; ע ׳משׁתי 3:9 לע ׳סלח Exod 34:9 ; Num 14:19 (J), Psa 25:11 ; 103:3 ; Jer 31:34 ; 33:8 ; 36:3 ; ע ׳נשׂא Exod 34:7 ; Num 14:18 (J), Psa 32:5 ; 85:3 ; Isa 33:24 ; Hosea 14:3 ; Micah 7:18 ; ע ׳סר Isa 6:7 ; ע ׳יכבושׁ Micah 7:19 ; (3) of covering over, ע על ׳כסה Nehemiah 3:37; ע ׳כמּר Psa 78:38 ; Prov 16:6 ; Isa 22:14 ; 27:9 ; Dan 9:24 ; ע על ׳כמּר Jer 18:23 ; ע ׳יתכמּר 1Sam 3:14 ; (4) of cleansing from: מע ׳כבּס Psa 51:4 ; ע ׳מחה 51:11 ; מע ׳טהר Jer 33:8 ; Ezek 36:33 ; (5) of imputing, reckoning to one: ע ׳חשׁב ל 2Sam 19:20 ; Psa 32:2 ; ע ׳זכר (לׅ 79:8 ; Isa 64:8 ; Jer 14:10 ; Hosea 8:13 ; 9:9 ; ע ׳יִזָּכֵר Psa 109:14 ; (ל)ע ׳בקשׁ Job 10:6 ; Jer 50:20 ; -6 מע ׳פדה Psa 130:8 ransom from iniquity . 2 Guilt of iniquity (not always easy to distinguished from 1 ; SS give more, Buhl fewer, sub 2 ); — || תועבות Ezek 36:31 ; || דם Isa 59:3 ; || חמס Ezek 9:9 ; ׳ע פעור Josh 22:17 (P); ׳ע סדם Ezek 16:49 ; ׳ע בצעוֺ Isa 57:17 ; עונם שְׁנֵי Ezek 4:4 ; לְפָנַי עֲוֺנֵךְ נִכְתָּם Jer 2:22 the guilt of thine iniquity is marked before me ; ע ׳מצא Gen 44:16 (E) Psa 36:3 . a. ׳ע בְ : guilt of iniquity upon one Num 15:31 (P) 1Sam 20:8 ; 2Sam 14:32 ; ע ׳לא לִי Job 33:9 (|| זַךְ ); בליעֿון Psa 59:5 without my guilt . b. guilt , as great, increased: עָוֺן רֹב Jer 13:22 ; 30:14-15 , Ezek 28:18 ; Hosea 9:7 ; ע ׳לֹאשָֿׁלֵם Gen 15:16 (J); ׳ע ראֹשִׁי עָֽבְרוּ Psa 38:5 ; ׳ע יְסוּבֵּנִי עֲקֵבַי 49:6 ; ׳ע הִשִּׂיגוּנִי 40:13 ; ׳ע מני גברו 65:4 ; ע כֶּבֶד ׳עַם Isa 1:4 ; ׳בע נלקח Ezek 33:6 . c. as a condition , ׳בע : with חוללתי was I brought forth Psa 51:7 ; with גָּוַע expire Josh 22:20 (P); with מות die Jer 31:30 ; Ezek 3:18-19 , 18:17-18 , 33:8-9 ,. 3 Consequence of, or punishment for, iniquity (SS include most of these under 2 , and do not recognize 3 ; Buhl thinks this meaning rare, giving only Gen 4:13 ; Isa 5:18 ); &#8212; הזה בדבר ע יִקְּ֯רֵךְ ׳אִם 1Sam 28:10 no punishment shall happen unto thee for , etc.; ע ׳נשׂא bear the punishment for iniquity of others Exod 28:38 ; Lev 10:17 ( take away ׳ע Di Now ii. 233 n .) 16:22 ; Num 30:16 (P), Ezek 4:4-5 , 6 ; ׳בע 18:19-20 , (twice in verse); one's own, Exod 28:43 ; Lev 5:1 , 17 ; 7:18 ; 17:16 ; 19:8 ; 20:17 , 19 ; 22:16 ; Num 5:31 ; 14:34 ; 18:1 (twice in verse); 18:23 (P), Ezek 14:10 ; 44:10 , 12 ; ע מנשׂוא׳גדול Gen 4:13 (J) my punishment is greater than I can bear ; עֲוֺנָהּ נִרְצָה Isa 40:2 her punishment is accepted , compare ע ׳רצה Lev 26:41 , 43 (H); ע ׳ומצאנוּ 2Kin 7:9 punishment will overtake us ; ע ׳תנה ע ׳על Psa 69:28 add punishment to their punishment ; ׳ע יסבל הוא Isa 53:11 the consequences of their iniquities he shall bear , compare ׳ע סָבָ֑לְנוּ Lam 5:7 ; ע בו ׳הפגיע Isa 53:6 ; מע ׳נִקָּה freed from punishment Num 5:31 (P) Job 10:14 ; העון אני בי 1Sam 25:24 on me the punishment ; הע ׳עלי 2Sam 14:9 ; ׳בע with various verbs: Gen 19:15 (J) Lev 26:39 (twice in verse) (H) Psa 31:11 ; 106:43 ; Jer 51:6 ; Ezek 4:17 ; 7:16 ; 24:23 ; 39:23 ; ע ׳עת קץ 21:30 ; Ezekiel 21:34; 35:5 ; see also: Prov 5:22 (|| חטאת חַבְלֵי ), Isa 30:13 ; 64:5 ; 64:6 ; Lam 4:22 ; Ezek 4:4 ; 14:10 (twice in verse); 32:27 .","rootNote":"or עָווֹן ; (2 Kings 7:9; Psalm 51:5 [7]), from 5753 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 21 8","keyReferences":["1Chr 21 8","1Kgs 17 18","1Sam 3 13","1Sam 3 14","1Sam 18 9","1Sam 20 1","1Sam 20 8","1Sam 25 24"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":232,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 21 8","book":"1Chr","chapter":21,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֲו֣וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 17 18","book":"1Kgs","chapter":17,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֲוֺנִ֖/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"1Sam 3 13","book":"1Sam","chapter":3,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/עֲוֺ֣ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncbsc"},{"reference":"1Sam 3 14","book":"1Sam","chapter":3,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֲוֺ֧ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsc"},{"reference":"1Sam 18 9","book":"1Sam","chapter":18,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עון","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 20 1","book":"1Sam","chapter":20,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֲוֺנִ֤/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"1Sam 20 8","book":"1Sam","chapter":20,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עָוֺן֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 25 24","book":"1Sam","chapter":25,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הֶֽ/עָוֺ֑ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 28 10","book":"1Sam","chapter":28,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עָוֺ֖ן","source":"hebrew","mor